# =========================================================================
# VVDN -- KICH BAN CAT HA CANH, 60 PHUT, HUONG 35, MOT PHA -- MIX 2D1A
# 35L ha canh (ILS) / 35R cat canh -- hai duong CHC song song PHU THUOC
# =========================================================================
# Sinh boi _gen_vvdn_2d1a.py, seed 20261106. Quy tac: vvdn_2d1a_rules.json + vvdn_xenke_rules.json.
# Mix: 2D1A (chu ky: 1 tau den - 2 tau di)
# Quy mo: 14 chuyen den + 28 chuyen di = 42 chuyen dong (+2 tau giu diem cho, khong chay da)
# Co cau: DEN 7 MEDIUM + 7 HEAVY | DI 22 MEDIUM + 6 HEAVY; HEAVY rai deu ca 60 phut
# Loi thoat: 9 tau qua G6 ve ben 8 (moi tau HEAVY), 5 tau MEDIUM qua G4 ve ben 28
# Cham banh dau 00:01:35.000, cuoi 00:57:31.375; chay da cuoi 00:59:48.375
# Nhip cham banh TB 258.2 s (nho nhat 240.0, lon nhat 284.5)
#
# PHAN CACH AP DUNG:
#   Cat canh 35R vs tau den ke tiep tren 35L (NM, hang = tau cat canh, cot = tau ha canh): H H=6, H M=7, M H=5, M M=5
#     (tinh tai luc cap huan lenh = chay da - 10 s code C / 15 s code D tro len)
#   Tau di thu nhat: huan lenh 2 s sau khi tau den cham banh, chay da sau huan lenh 10 s (code C) / 15 s (code D tro len)
#   Tau di thu hai: sau tau di thu nhat 120 s (moi SID chung chang dau; HEAVY sau MEDIUM 150 s),
#     va chi cap huan lenh sau khi tau den da cat qua het 35R
#   Tau ha canh truoc thoat ly het khoi 35L (duoi tau qua vach dung cho 35L) truoc khi tau sau toi 2 NM
#   Ha canh lien tiep 35L: giam sat ATS va nhieu dong theo vvdn_xenke_rules.json
#   Duong lan E: tau code D/E/F cat canh thi chi tau code C o tren E (du thao muc 3)
#   Tau MEDIUM qua G4 chi khi tau di tranh duoc tren doan duong lan dung chung
#   Hai tau di lien tiep dung hai nhom SID khac nhau de tau sau khong duoi kip tau truoc
#   Diem cho truoc 35R: toi da 3 tau, gom ca tau da len CHC
#
# GIA DINH:
#   Tau den/di dau tien tao giua duong luc 0 de khong co pha khoi dong; khong gio, khong bay lai; ASAS OFF.
#   Tau di bi xoa 420 s sau chay da; tau den bi xoa khi toi ben; pha lan dieu khien bang MOVE nhip 2 s.
#
# CANH BAO KHI SINH:
#   (khong co)
# =========================================================================

